* ==============================================================================================
* DAB_L_LLG : PM-SPICE MLM of 'DAB_L' with LLG_CORE (nonlinear) ferrites
* generated by m2spice_llg.py from tida_L.txt (PM-SPICE usage example: ELP38 3-turn series inductor, gap 766.2 um)
* ==============================================================================================
* 1 windings, 3 layers, MLM computed at f = 150000 Hz
*   winding 1: ports PortP1/PortN1, layers [1, 2, 3], series, 3 turns
* ferrites (field domain T0-G top, T4-G bottom):
*   PM-SPICE Lft = 3.17129e-07 H, Lfb = 9.59439e-05 H  (mur = 2200)
*   = gap || plate: Lgap_t = 3.1818e-07, Lgap_b = none (gb=0), Lplate = mu0*mur*c*d/w = 9.59439e-05 H
*   plate -> LLG_CORE N=1, Ae=0.000194 m^2, le=0.02185 m (core_area = Ac, core_le = 0.0437 m)
*   the LLG parameters on the .subckt line set the material; mur is not used.
* Simulate with:  .tran <dt> <tstop> <tstart> <dtmax> uic
*                 .options method=gear chgtol=1e-12
* uic is required (the magnetization starts from mx0, my0, mz0).
* Monitor, for an instance XU1: V(xu1:xft:b), V(xu1:xfb:b) [T], V(xu1:xft:h) [A/m],
*   I(xu1:xft:Vsns) = plate MMF [A]; V(xu1:t0) - V(xu1:g) = top-ferrite volts per turn.
* ==============================================================================================

.subckt DAB_L_LLG PortP1 PortN1
+ params: Ms=388000 alpha=5.13333 gamma=1.76e+11 Hani_z=2.79483 Hani_y=127.943 mx0=0 my0=1 mz0=0
* layer 1 (m = 1)
Le1 J1_2 PortP1 1 Rser=1f
Li1 G Md1 1 Rser=1f
Lg1 Mg1 Md1 -6.69387e-11 Rser=1f
Rg1 Mc1 Mg1 0.00449827
Rt1 Mc1 Mt1 1.32717e-06
Rb1 Mb1 Mc1 1.32717e-06
Lt1 T1 Mt1 2.00822e-10 Rser=1f
Lb1 Mb1 B1 2.00822e-10 Rser=1f
Ls1 B1 T2 1.31976e-08 Rser=1f
K1 Le1 Li1 1
* layer 2 (m = 1)
Le2 J2_3 J1_2 1 Rser=1f
Li2 G Md2 1 Rser=1f
Lg2 Mg2 Md2 -6.69387e-11 Rser=1f
Rg2 Mc2 Mg2 0.00449827
Rt2 Mc2 Mt2 1.32717e-06
Rb2 Mb2 Mc2 1.32717e-06
Lt2 T2 Mt2 2.00822e-10 Rser=1f
Lb2 Mb2 B2 2.00822e-10 Rser=1f
Ls2 B2 T3 2.69691e-08 Rser=1f
K2 Le2 Li2 1
* layer 3 (m = 1)
Le3 PortN1 J2_3 1 Rser=1f
Li3 G Md3 1 Rser=1f
Lg3 Mg3 Md3 -6.69387e-11 Rser=1f
Rg3 Mc3 Mg3 0.00449827
Rt3 Mc3 Mt3 1.32717e-06
Rb3 Mb3 Mc3 1.32717e-06
Lt3 T3 Mt3 2.00822e-10 Rser=1f
Lb3 Mb3 B3 2.00822e-10 Rser=1f
Ls3 B3 T4 1.72143e-08 Rser=1f
K3 Le3 Li3 1
* top spacing
Ls0 T1 T0 3.44286e-10 Rser=1f
* winding interconnects: layer terminals merged into the port / J<a>_<b> nodes
*   winding 1: layers [1, 2, 3], series
* reference for the floating field domain
Rgnd G 0 1G
* top ferrite: gap || plate
Lgapt T0 G 3.1818e-07 Rser=1f
XFt T0 G LLGC_DAB_L Ms={Ms} alpha={alpha} gamma={gamma} Hani_z={Hani_z} Hani_y={Hani_y} mx0={mx0} my0={my0} mz0={mz0} mu0=1.2566e-6
+ N=1 Ae=0.000194 le=0.02185 vac=1
* bottom ferrite: gap || plate
XFb T4 G LLGC_DAB_L Ms={Ms} alpha={alpha} gamma={gamma} Hani_z={Hani_z} Hani_y={Hani_y} mx0={mx0} my0={my0} mz0={mz0} mu0=1.2566e-6
+ N=1 Ae=0.000194 le=0.02185 vac=1
.ends DAB_L_LLG

* ---- LLG core, copied from LTspice_LLG/model/LLG_core.lib (renamed)
.subckt LLGC_DAB_L p n params: Ms=3.88e5 alpha=10 gamma=1.76e11 mu0=1.2566e-6
+ Hani_z=60 Hani_y=60 N=1 Ae=7.638e-4 le=19e-3 vac=1
+ mx0=0 my0=1 mz0=0 kn=1e5

.param pref = {-gamma*mu0/(1+alpha*alpha)}
.param KH   = {N/le}
.param KV   = {N*Ae*mu0*Ms}
.param Lvac = {max(vac*mu0*N*N*Ae/le, 1e-15)}

* ---- electrical port: sense -> vacuum inductance -> magnetization back-EMF
Vsns p a 0
Lv   a c {Lvac} Rser=0
BvM  c n V={KV}*V(dz)

* ---- applied field and effective z field
Bh   h  0 V={KH}*I(Vsns)
Bhz  hz 0 V=V(h) + {Hani_z}*V(mz)/sqrt(V(mx)*V(mx)+V(my)*V(my)+V(mz)*V(mz)+1e-30)

* ---- m x H_eff,  H_eff = (0, Hani_y, hz)
Bcx  cx 0 V=V(my)*V(hz) - V(mz)*{Hani_y}
Bcy  cy 0 V=-V(mx)*V(hz)
Bcz  cz 0 V=V(mx)*{Hani_y}

* ---- dm/dt = pref*( m x H + alpha * m x (m x H) ) - kn*(|m|^2-1)*m
Bn2  n2 0 V=V(mx)*V(mx)+V(my)*V(my)+V(mz)*V(mz)-1
Bdx  dx 0 V={pref}*(V(cx) + {alpha}*(V(my)*V(cz) - V(mz)*V(cy))) - {kn}*V(n2)*V(mx)
Bdy  dy 0 V={pref}*(V(cy) + {alpha}*(V(mz)*V(cx) - V(mx)*V(cz))) - {kn}*V(n2)*V(my)
Bdz  dz 0 V={pref}*(V(cz) + {alpha}*(V(mx)*V(cy) - V(my)*V(cx))) - {kn}*V(n2)*V(mz)

* ---- integrators: V(m*) = state
Bix  0 mx I=V(dx)
Cmx  mx 0 1 ic={mx0}
Biy  0 my I=V(dy)
Cmy  my 0 1 ic={my0}
Biz  0 mz I=V(dz)
Cmz  mz 0 1 ic={mz0}

* ---- monitor
Bb   b 0 V={mu0}*(V(h) + {Ms}*V(mz))
.ends LLGC_DAB_L

